{% comment %}
  Collection — 集合页主体（task-collection T-2.1/T-2.2/T-2.3/T-2.4/T-3.1，pages-ui §4）。

  结构（2026-10-14 效果图 v2）：
  横幅矩形图（全幅，LCP eager）→ 白色圆角卡上移侵入（面包屑 + h1 + 描述
  + 筛选/内容两栏 + 网格 + 分页）。曲线全部 CSS：border-radius + 伪元素
  radial-gradient 反向弧；图片不烤形状；移动端（<990px）白卡不侵入贴底。

  复用（搜索页将复用同组积木，task-collection §0）：
  - snippets/faceted-filters.liquid（筛选组）/ active-facets.liquid（已选标签）
  - snippets/product-card.liquid + assets/product-card.css（商品卡）
  - assets/faceted-filters.js（`<collection-facets>`：拦截 GET 表单 → Section Rendering API
    局部更新 + replaceState；移动端 <dialog> 抽屉承载同一份筛选 DOM）

  红线对齐：数据与计数全部来自服务端重算（collection.filters / filter_value.count），
  前端零筛选逻辑；无 JS 全功能可退化（整页 GET 提交）。

  空态分支：products_count > 0 → 网格；有筛选器且已激活但 0 结果 → no-matches
  （清筛选入口）；否则 → 真空集合空态（全部商品入口，pages-ui §4）。
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign per_page = section.settings.products_per_page | default: 12
  assign has_active_filters = false
  for filter in collection.filters
    if filter.type == 'price_range'
      if filter.min_value.value != blank or filter.max_value.value != blank
        assign has_active_filters = true
        break
      endif
    else
      for value in filter.values
        if value.active
          assign has_active_filters = true
          break
        endif
      endfor
    endif
    if has_active_filters
      break
    endif
  endfor
  assign has_banner = false
  if collection.image and section.settings.show_banner
    assign has_banner = true
  endif
-%}

<script src="{{ 'compare-toggle.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'wishlist-toggle.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
<script src="{{ 'quick-add.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- if collection.filters.size > 0 -%}
  <script src="{{ 'faceted-filters.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
{%- endif -%}
{{ 'product-card.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<div class="collection{% unless has_banner %} collection--no-banner{% endunless %} full-width" data-collection-root>
  {%- capture intro_content -%}
    <nav class="collection__breadcrumb" aria-label="{{ 'collections.breadcrumb_label' | t }}">
      <ol class="collection__breadcrumb-list" role="list">
        <li class="collection__breadcrumb-item">
          <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">{{ 'collections.breadcrumb_home' | t }}</a>
        </li>
        <li class="collection__breadcrumb-item" aria-current="page">{{ collection.title | escape }}</li>
      </ol>
    </nav>

    <header class="collection__head">
      <h1 class="collection__title">{{ collection.title | escape }}</h1>
      {%- if collection.description != blank -%}
        <div class="collection__description rte">{{ collection.description }}</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </header>
  {%- endcapture -%}

  {%- if has_banner -%}
    <div class="collection__banner">
      {{
        collection.image
        | image_url: width: 2400
        | image_tag:
          widths: '750, 1100, 1500, 2000, 2400',
          sizes: '100vw',
          width: collection.image.width,
          height: collection.image.height,
          loading: 'eager',
          fetchpriority: 'high',
          alt: collection.image.alt
      }}
      <div class="collection__intro">{{ intro_content }}</div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    <div class="collection__intro collection__intro--plain">{{ intro_content }}</div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="collection__sheet">
    <collection-facets class="collection__facets" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
      <div class="collection__layout{% if collection.filters.size == 0 %} collection__layout--no-facets{% endif %}" data-facets-layout>
        {%- if collection.filters.size > 0 -%}
          <form
            class="facets__form"
            id="FacetsForm-{{ section.id }}"
            action="{{ collection.url }}"
            method="get"
            data-facets-form
          >
            {%- comment -%}
              左列两张卡（2026-10-16 刘工定）：排序卡在上，筛选卡在下。
              桌面：排序卡留在 form 内。移动端：faceted-filters.js 把这一张卡
              移进工具条（pages-ui §4 移动端工具条 = [筛选☰] [排序▾]）——同一
              DOM 节点，不做副本。故 select 恒带 form 属性：离开 form 子树后仍是
              表单成员，FormData / requestSubmit / 无 JS 原生提交都照常带上 sort_by。
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if section.settings.show_sort -%}
              <div class="facets__sort-card">
                <label class="facets__sort-card-label" for="SortBy-{{ section.id }}">
                  {{ 'collections.sort.label' | t }}
                </label>
                <select
                  id="SortBy-{{ section.id }}"
                  name="sort_by"
                  data-facets-sort
                  form="FacetsForm-{{ section.id }}"
                >
                  {%- for option in collection.sort_options -%}
                    <option
                      value="{{ option.value }}"
                      {% if option.value == collection.sort_by %}
                        selected
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      {{ option.name | escape }}
                    </option>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </select>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {% render 'faceted-filters', filters: collection.filters %}
          </form>
        {%- endif -%}

        <div class="collection__content">
          <div class="collection__toolbar">
            {%- if collection.filters.size > 0 -%}
              <button
                type="button"
                class="facets__open"
                data-facets-open
                aria-controls="FacetsDialog-{{ section.id }}"
              >
                {{ 'collections.filters.open' | t }}
              </button>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- comment -%}
              无筛选集合：没有左列，也就没有 form —— 排序常驻工具条行尾
              （桌面与移动端同一处）。无 form 可提交 → 不带 form 属性；
              JS 走 _onChange 的「无表单」独立局部更新分支。
              与有筛选集合的排序卡复用同一套类名：工具条里有它自己的横排形态。
            {%- endcomment -%}
            {%- if collection.filters.size == 0 and section.settings.show_sort -%}
              <div class="facets__sort-card">
                <label class="facets__sort-card-label" for="SortBy-{{ section.id }}">
                  {{ 'collections.sort.label' | t }}
                </label>
                <select id="SortBy-{{ section.id }}" name="sort_by" data-facets-sort>
                  {%- for option in collection.sort_options -%}
                    <option
                      value="{{ option.value }}"
                      {% if option.value == collection.sort_by %}
                        selected
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      {{ option.name | escape }}
                    </option>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </select>
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- comment -%} 计数：桌面在已选标签右侧（CSS order 控制），移动端行尾 {%- endcomment -%}
            <p class="collection__count" aria-live="polite" data-facets-count>
              {{ 'navigation.products_count' | t: count: collection.products_count }}
            </p>

            {%- render 'active-facets', filters: collection.filters, clear_url: collection.url -%}
          </div>

          <div class="collection__results" data-facets-results tabindex="-1">
            {%- paginate collection.products by per_page -%}
              {%- if collection.products_count > 0 -%}
                <ul class="collection__grid" role="list">
                  {%- for product in collection.products -%}
                    <li class="collection__item">
                      {%- liquid
                        assign card_lazy = true
                        assign card_width = false
                        assign card_cc = false
                        assign card_power = false
                        assign card_weight = false
                        if forloop.index <= 4
                          assign card_lazy = false
                        endif
                        if section.settings.show_spec_width
                          assign card_width = true
                        endif
                        if section.settings.show_spec_cc
                          assign card_cc = true
                        endif
                        if section.settings.show_spec_power
                          assign card_power = true
                        endif
                        if section.settings.show_spec_weight
                          assign card_weight = true
                        endif
                      -%}
                      {% render 'product-card',
                        product: product,
                        lazy: card_lazy,
                        quick_add: section.settings.show_quick_add,
                        show_width: card_width,
                        show_cc: card_cc,
                        show_power: card_power,
                        show_weight: card_weight
                      %}
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>

                {%- if paginate.pages > 1 -%}
                  <nav class="collection__pagination" aria-label="{{ 'collections.pagination_label' | t }}">
                    {{ paginate | default_pagination }}
                  </nav>
                {%- endif -%}
              {%- elsif has_active_filters -%}
                {%- comment -%} 筛选后无结果：有筛选器已激活但当前组合无商品 {%- endcomment -%}
                <div class="collection__empty">
                  <p class="collection__empty-title">{{ 'collections.no_matches' | t }}</p>
                  <a class="collection__empty-link" href="{{ collection.url }}">
                    {{ 'collections.clear_filters' | t }}
                  </a>
                </div>
              {%- else -%}
                {%- comment -%} 真空集合：空态 + 全部商品入口（pages-ui §4 状态要点） {%- endcomment -%}
                <div class="collection__empty">
                  <p class="collection__empty-title">{{ 'collections.empty.title' | t }}</p>
                  <p class="collection__empty-body">{{ 'collections.empty.body' | t }}</p>
                  <a class="collection__empty-link" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
                    {{ 'collections.empty.link' | t }}
                  </a>
                </div>
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endpaginate -%}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </collection-facets>
  </div>

  {%- if collection.filters.size > 0 -%}
    <dialog
      id="FacetsDialog-{{ section.id }}"
      class="facets__dialog"
      scroll-lock
      aria-label="{{ 'collections.filters.label' | t }}"
    ></dialog>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /* 包裹层退回 block：section 顶部的 script/link 标签不能成为 .shopify-section
     grid 的 item（否则会在横幅上方挤出空行，破坏"沉浸贴页头"）；通栏由根 div
     的 full-width + 内部 grid 自行管理。 */
  .shopify-section.collection-section {
    display: block;
  }
  .collection {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--content-grid);
    width: 100%;
  }
  .collection > * {
    grid-column: 2;
  }
  .collection > .collection__banner {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  /* 横幅沉浸通栏（贴页头）：面包屑/标题/描述白字直接叠图，
     左向暗化渐变 + text-shadow 保证可读性（WCAG 对比度）。 */
  .collection {
    --banner-h: clamp(200px, 30vh, 340px);
  }
  .collection__banner {
    position: relative;
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    height: var(--banner-h);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .collection__banner > img {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .collection__banner::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, rgb(0 0 0 / 40%), rgb(0 0 0 / 14%) 55%, rgb(0 0 0 / 0%) 85%);
  }
  .collection__intro {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 100%;
    /* 与下方主体同一条内容列：intro 自己跑 content-grid，文字落第 2 列 */
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--content-grid);
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .collection__intro > * {
    grid-column: 2;
  }
  .collection__banner .collection__breadcrumb-list,
  .collection__banner .collection__breadcrumb-item a {
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 82%);
  }
  .collection__banner .collection__breadcrumb-item a:hover {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .collection__banner .collection__title,
  .collection__banner .collection__description {
    color: #ffffff;
    text-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgb(0 0 0 / 35%);
  }
  .collection__banner .collection__title {
    margin-block-start: 0.35rem;
  }
  /* 无横幅：介绍区黑字常规排版（同样走内容列） */
  .collection--no-banner .collection__intro--plain {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    padding-block: 2rem 0;
  }
  .collection--no-banner .collection__intro--plain .collection__breadcrumb-list {
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 55%);
  }
  @media (max-width: 989.98px) {
    .collection__banner {
      height: clamp(170px, 26vh, 260px);
    }
    .collection__title {
      font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 6vw, 2rem);
    }
  }

  /* 面包屑 */
  .collection__breadcrumb-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 55%);
  }
  .collection__breadcrumb-item + .collection__breadcrumb-item::before {
    content: '/';
    margin-inline-end: 0.35rem;
  }
  .collection__breadcrumb-item a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .collection__breadcrumb-item a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .collection__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.2vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.12;
  }
  .collection__description {
    margin-block-start: 0.5rem;
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 65%);
  }

  /* 两栏：筛选 + 内容。桌面 ≥990px 恒两栏（纯 CSS，不依赖 JS）；
     无 JS 降级：应用按钮整页提交。移动端单列，JS 就绪后 Filters 按钮开抽屉。 */
  .collection__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
  }

  /* 左列 = 两张卡堆叠（2026-10-16 刘工定：排序卡在上、筛选卡在下）。
     桌面由 ≥990px 规则给卡面；移动端 form 整体进抽屉，改 block + 分隔线。 */
  .facets__form {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .facets__sort-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-content: start;
  }
  .facets__sort-card-label {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .facets__sort-card select {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 6px 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 25%);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  /* 排序卡在工具条里的形态（无筛选集合常驻；有筛选集合仅移动端，由 JS 移入）：
     竖向卡面变横排，靠行尾。桌面无筛选集合靠 auto 外边距右贴，计数跟在它右侧。 */
  .collection__toolbar .facets__sort-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    min-width: 0;
    margin-inline-start: auto;
  }
  .collection__toolbar .facets__sort-card select {
    width: auto;
  }

  /* 工具条 */
  .collection__toolbar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    min-height: 44px;
  }
  .facets__open {
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 1rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 25%);
    border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
    background: none;
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .collection__count {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 60%);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  /* 已选标签：移动端独占一行（规格「已选标签横滑」）；桌面与计数同行（order 见 ≥990px） */
  .facets__active {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex-basis: 100%;
  }
  .facets__chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .facets__chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    min-height: 32px;
    padding: 4px 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 20%);
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .facets__chip:hover {
    border-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
  }
  .facets__chip-x {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 50%);
  }
  .facets__clear {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
  }

  /* 筛选组 */
  .facets__group {
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }
  .facets__group-label {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0;
    margin-block-end: 0.5rem;
  }
  .facets__values {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.15rem;
  }
  .facets__value-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .facets__value-label input[type='checkbox'] {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    accent-color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
  .facets__value-text {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .facets__value-count {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 45%);
  }
  .facets__price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .facets__price-field input {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 6px 0.6rem;
    border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 25%);
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }
  .facets__apply {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 44px;
    margin-block-start: 0.75rem;
    padding: 10px 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
    background-color: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-background);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 网格 */
  .collection__results {
    position: relative;
    margin-block-start: 0.5rem;
  }
  .collection__results:focus {
    outline: none;
  }
  .collection__facets[aria-busy='true'] .collection__results {
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* 加载骨架（faceted-filters.js 的 _showSkeleton）：fetch 期间盖住结果区。
     列数复刻 .collection__grid 的三档断点；底色走全局变量，Noir 下自动适配；
     动画按 prefers-reduced-motion 关停（无障碍红线）。 */
  .collection__skeleton {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-content: start;
    background: var(--color-background);
  }
  .collection__skeleton-card {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-content: start;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border: 0.5px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 8%);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .collection__skeleton-card .sk-img {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 7%);
  }
  .collection__skeleton-card .sk-line {
    width: 70%;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 7%);
  }
  .collection__skeleton-card .sk-line--short {
    width: 40%;
  }
  .collection__skeleton-card .sk-line--price {
    width: 30%;
  }
  @keyframes skeleton-pulse {
    0%,
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    50% {
      opacity: 0.55;
    }
  }
  .collection__skeleton-card > * {
    animation: skeleton-pulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .collection__skeleton {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .collection__skeleton {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .collection__skeleton-card > * {
      animation: none;
    }
  }
  .collection__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .collection__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .collection__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    }
  }

  /* 分页 */
  .collection__pagination {
    margin-block-start: 1.5rem;
  }
  .collection__pagination a,
  .collection__pagination [aria-current] {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 44px;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 0.6rem;
    border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .collection__pagination a:hover {
    background-color: rgb(0 0 0 / 6%);
  }
  .collection__pagination [aria-current='page'] {
    background-color: var(--color-foreground);
    color: var(--color-background);
  }

  /* 空态 */
  .collection__empty {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 3rem 1rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px dashed rgb(0 0 0 / 20%);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .collection__empty-title {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .collection__empty-body {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: rgb(0 0 0 / 60%);
  }
  .collection__empty-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 1.25rem;
    margin-block-start: 0.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-foreground);
    border-radius: var(--style-border-radius-inputs);
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* 移动抽屉（dialog 承载同一份筛选 DOM，JS 把 aside 移入） */
  .facets__dialog {
    border: none;
    border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    width: min(420px, 92vw);
    max-height: 85vh;
    margin: auto auto 0;
  }
  .facets__dialog::backdrop {
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 40%);
  }
  .facets__dialog .facets__panel {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem calc(1.5rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    overflow-y: auto;
    max-height: 85vh;
  }
  .facets__mobile-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
  }
  .facets__panel-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .facets__close {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 8px 0.75rem;
    border: none;
    background: none;
    font: inherit;
    color: var(--color-brand-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* 桌面两栏：纯 CSS 媒体查询，不依赖 JS（无 JS 也能筛选——应用按钮整页 GET 提交）。
     data-facets-ready 只负责：隐藏应用按钮（change 即提交）+ 移动端 Filters 按钮/抽屉。 */
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .collection__layout {
      /* 230 → 260px：卡面内边距占用 2.5rem，留足筛选标签宽度 */
      grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    /* 无筛选集合不渲染表单：内容区独占整行，不空一列 */
    .collection__layout--no-facets {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    /* 左列两张卡：排序卡在上、筛选卡在下（描边 + 圆角 + 内边距） */
    .facets__sort-card,
    .facets__aside {
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 10%);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background-color: var(--color-background);
    }
    /* 最后一组筛选不再留底边距——卡片内边距已提供呼吸感 */
    .facets__aside .facets__group:last-of-type {
      margin-block-end: 0;
    }
    /* 工具条行序：已选标签在左（可换行），计数靠行尾。有筛选集合的排序卡在
       左列（不在此处）；无筛选集合的排序卡常驻工具条，排在计数左侧
       ——「计数在 Sort by 右侧」（2026-10-16 刘工）在两种形态下都成立。 */
    .collection__toolbar .facets__active {
      order: 1;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .collection__toolbar .facets__sort-card {
      order: 2;
    }
    .collection__toolbar .collection__count {
      order: 3;
    }
    .facets__mobile-head {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  .collection__facets[data-facets-ready] .facets__apply {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 989.98px) {
    .collection__facets[data-facets-ready] .facets__open {
      display: inline-flex;
    }
    /* 抽屉承载筛选 DOM：form 整体移入 dialog（见 faceted-filters.js），
       流内不再渲染，产品列表回到工具条正下方（BUG-042）。无 JS 时
       data-facets-ready 缺席，筛选面板照常流内展示。 */
    .collection__facets[data-facets-ready] .facets__form {
      display: none;
    }
    /* 抽屉/无 JS 流内：排序卡与筛选块之间用分隔线（面板自带留白，不做卡面） */
    .facets__form {
      display: block;
    }
    .facets__sort-card {
      padding-block-end: 0.9rem;
      margin-block-end: 0.9rem;
      border-block-end: 1px solid rgb(0 0 0 / 10%);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .facets__dialog {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

